# Copy this file to .env.secrets and fill in real values.
# .env.secrets is gitignored and overrides configs/sabnzbd/.env.
# Empty: the linuxserver/sabnzbd image never reads SABNZBD_USERNAME/PASSWORD/
# NZB_KEY (verified by grepping the image), so a former copy of them here was
# dead weight. The real values live only in configs/sabnzbd/config/sabnzbd.ini.
# The API key is shared with sabnzbd_exporter and homepage, so it lives in
# configs/sabnzbd/secrets/api_key.txt and is delivered to each consumer via
# compose `secrets:`. See docs/COMPOSE_CONVENTIONS.md.
